Evaluate these six dimensions:

1. SPAM LEGITIMACY
Assess whether the message is genuinely spam, genuinely legitimate, or ambiguous. Rule-based spam detection uses keyword matching which causes false positives (educational content discussing scam-detection, for example) and false negatives (sophisticated spam that avoids trigger words). Consider:
- Does the message have genuine educational substance?
